{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgr6DtcWJFTQnouoLyMFJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The catastrophic loss is a capturing race: my big center group died while my net played small corner moves — it has no notion of liberty counts beyond atari. To add \"≤2 liberty\" detection for opponent groups (atari moves) I need L6 capacity. One option is to compute per-stone tactical indicators at L5 and sum them per point in a single L6 unit, at the cost of 1 step of flood radius. Let me measure how much radius 3 vs 4 matters on real game positions.\n\n```python\nexec(open('/work/ana.py').read())\nfrom collections import Counter\nG=json.load(open('/work/pass_11/games.json')); Bd=np.load('/work/pass_11/boards.npy')\ndef tob(arr): return [1 if x==1 else (2 if x==-1 else 0) for x in arr]\ndef star_pl(b,v):\n    c=b[v]; return sum(e(b,q) for q in [v]+NB[v] if b[q]==c)\ncnt=Counter()\nfor gi,g in enumerate(G):\n    for k in range(5,len(g['moves']),4):\n        b=tob(Bd[gi,k])\n        for t in range(81):\n            if not b[t] or not any(b[q]==0 for q in NB[t]): continue\n            gg,l=group(b,t)\n            if len(l)<2: continue\n            dist=chain_dist(b,t)\n            wd=[dist[v] for v in gg if hv_witness(b,v)]\n            md=min(wd) if wd else 99\n            # flood radius r means witness center within r-? ; AtO at L6 uses witness centers within 4 (L3:1, L4:2, L5:3, L6:4)\n            cnt['n']+=1\n            for r in (2,3,4): cnt['false_r%d'%r]+= (md>r)\nprint({k:v for k,v in cnt.items()}, {k:round(v/cnt['n'],4) for k,v in cnt.items()})\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6879,"cache_read_input_tokens":340234,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6879},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_tr